  "details": "SDK version: 2020.05.06.12.14\nFiring SendRPC ExitStation only works Locally and if you are sitting in that station effected by the trigger. According to the logs the trigger is blocked by the person sitting in the station. It doesn't matter if the triggered calling the SendRPC is a unbuffered trigger. I have made a test world to show this. https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_6743a9ed-94cf-43e3-a4d7-d65bdb830b44&instanceId=55401~private(usr_7ec23ebf-254f-4dac-9d62-f90194affd52)~nonce(64264bab-153e-43b5-b43b-3dec0a045675)",
